---
import type { NotoooBook } from '../../data/notooo';
interface Props { book: NotoooBook; compact?: boolean; }
const { book, compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<article class:list={['sheet', { compact }]} data-notooo-sheet aria-label={`${book.title} one-page visual synthesis`}>
  <header><span>NOTOOO 001 · {book.category.toUpperCase()}</span><h2>{book.title}</h2><p>{book.author} · {book.publicationYear}</p></header>
  <section class="big"><b>BIG IDEA</b><p>{book.sheet.bigIdea}</p><strong>{book.sheet.systemsLine}</strong></section>
  <div class="two"><section><b>WHO ARE YOU BECOMING?</b><p>Instead of only asking “What do I want?”, ask “Who do I want to become?”</p><strong>{book.sheet.identity}</strong></section><section><b>GOAL vs SYSTEM</b><p>Goals choose the direction. Systems move you there.</p><strong>Destination ← Goal<br/>Path ← System</strong></section></div>
  <section class="loop"><b>HOW A HABIT FORMS</b><strong>{book.sheet.habitLoop.join(' → ')} ↻</strong><p>Cue: notice · Craving: want · Response: act · Reward: value</p></section>
  <section><b>THE FOUR LAWS</b><div class="laws">{book.sheet.laws.map((law, index)=><div><em>{index + 1}</em><strong>{law.title}</strong><p>{law.note}</p></div>)}</div><small>BREAK A BAD HABIT → Invisible · Unattractive · Difficult · Unsatisfying</small></section>
  <div class="two"><section><b>DESIGN THE ROOM</b><p>{book.sheet.environment}</p><strong>🍎 visible · 🍪 hidden</strong></section><section><b>TWO-MINUTE RULE</b><p>{book.sheet.startSmall}</p><strong>2 minutes → start → continue</strong></section></div>
  <div class="two"><section><b>PROGRESS NEEDS TIME</b><p>Small results can be invisible first.</p><svg viewBox="0 0 200 80" role="img" aria-label="An upward curve showing delayed visible results"><path d="M8 68 C70 68,110 66,130 45 S164 18,192 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M8 70H196" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></section><section><b>RETURN QUICKLY</b><p>{book.sheet.consistency}</p><strong>✓ ✓ ✓ ✓ ✕ ✓ ✓ ✓</strong></section></div>
  <section class="example"><b>WANT TO BECOME A READER?</b><p>I am a reader. ↓ Leave a book visible. ↓ Read one page. ↓ Mark the day complete. ↓ Repeat tomorrow.</p></section>
  <section class="take"><b>KHIZOOO TAKE</b><p>{book.sheet.takeaway}</p></section>
  <footer><b>REMEMBER →</b><strong>{book.sheet.remember}</strong><span>Small → Repeat → Become · notooo · khizooo</span></footer>
</article>
<style>
.sheet{--ink:#27303a;--accent:#e38d7c;box-sizing:border-box;width:min(100%,794px);aspect-ratio:210/297;margin:auto;padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem);display:grid;gap:clamp(.35rem,1vw,.7rem);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffdf5,#f7f0df);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid #d9cdb8;box-shadow:0 12px 45px #0002;font:clamp(.58rem,1.25vw,.85rem)/1.35 Mulish,sans-serif}.sheet header{border-bottom:3px solid var(--accent)}.sheet header span,.sheet b{font:900 .75em Poppins,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.09em}.sheet h2{margin:0;font:900 clamp(1.3rem,4vw,2.7rem)/1 Poppins,sans-serif}.sheet p{margin:.25rem 0}.sheet section{border:1.5px solid currentColor;border-radius:.45rem;padding:.55rem;background:#fffdf899}.sheet strong{display:block;font:800 .85em Poppins,sans-serif}.big{text-align:center;border:2px solid var(--accent)!important}.big p{font:800 1.1em Poppins,sans-serif}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.5rem}.loop{text-align:center}.loop>strong{font-size:1.1em;color:#c36c5c}.laws{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:.35rem;margin:.35rem 0}.laws div{padding:.3rem;border:1px dashed #b5987d}.laws em{font-style:normal;background:var(--accent);border-radius:50%;padding:.05rem .25rem;font-weight:900}.laws p{font-size:.85em}.sheet svg{width:100%;height:54px}.take{background:#fce3d9!important;transform:rotate(-.5deg)}.example{border-style:dashed!important}.sheet footer{display:grid;gap:.2rem;padding:.6rem;border-top:3px solid var(--accent)}.sheet footer strong{font-size:1.1em}.sheet footer span{font-size:.75em}.compact{font-size:35%;padding:5%;box-shadow:none}.compact .sheet{pointer-events:none}@media(max-width:560px){.sheet{font-size:clamp(.48rem,2.25vw,.68rem);padding:.75rem}.two{gap:.25rem}.laws{gap:.18rem}.sheet section{padding:.3rem}}@media print{.sheet{width:210mm;height:297mm;aspect-ratio:auto;box-shadow:none;border:0;page-break-inside:avoid}}
</style>
